  "previousLessonFinalBlock": {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "保留自己的两阶段分类与修复记录。接下来让一条条件同时考虑数量下限和库存上限，或表达几项要求满足任意一项；下一节再学习怎样把比较结果组合起来。"
  },
  "transitionDecision": "No amendment: 3.2 accurately introduces combining minimum/stock and any-one rules. Both 3.1 and 3.2 r1 remain wholly identical."
